  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a wok over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped green onions and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the julienned carrots and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped spinach and cook until wilted.",
    "In a small bowl, mix the soy sauce and red pepper flakes.",
    "Add the cooked sous-vide beef to the wok and stir in the soy sauce mixture.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Assemble the gimbap by laying a seaweed sheet flat, then spreading a thin layer of cooked rice onto the seaweed, leaving a 1-inch border at the top.",
    "Add the beef and vegetable mixture to the center of the rice.",
    "Roll the gimbap tightly using a bamboo sushi mat."
